ly report and prove the client's boost money is working.", "mode": "auto", "owner": "isabella", "tool": "Windsor.ai / Metricool", "when": "Monthly", "feeds": [], "done": false}]}], "date": ""}, {"id": "sys5", "code": "5", "name": "Ad creatives & A/B tests", "short": "Offer + diverse creative + real sales data back to Meta.", "cadence": "Monthly build, weekly review", "stages": [{"id": "st5", "name": "Ads loop", "when": "Monthly + weekly", "steps": [{"id": "ad-found", "title": "Foundations check", "short": "Offer, pixel + CAPI, Instant Forms, outcome stages, speed.", "detail": "No spend until all are green: an offer worth responding to, pixel and Conversions API, Instant Forms with qualifying questions, HubSpot outcome stages the client logs, and speed-to-lead under 5 minutes.", "mode": "manual", "owner": "andres", "tool": "Meta Events Manager + HubSpot", "when": "Onboarding", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-concepts", "title": "Choose ad concepts", "short": "Picked with the content plan; the same shoot captures them.", "detail": "Pick from the creative menu: direct-response, problem/solution, offer, testimonial, before/after, owner to camera, myth-buster, what to expect.", "mode": "hybrid", "owner": "isabella", "tool": "Claude Project + Notion", "when": "Week 4 of M-2", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-build", "title": "Build 10 ads", "short": "2 concepts × 3 hooks, 1 testimonial, 3 statics, all resized.", "detail": "Variants and resizes in 9:16, 4:5 and 1:1.", "mode": "hybrid", "owner": "editor", "tool": "Higgsfield + Canva + CapCut", "when": "Week 2 of M-1", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-launch", "title": "Launch the campaign", "short": "1 Leads campaign: prospecting + retargeting ad sets.", "detail": "Advantage+ on, location limited to the service area, 6–15 genuinely different ads per ad set, about 70–80% prospecting and 20–30% retargeting.", "mode": "manual", "owner": "isabella", "tool": "Meta Ads Manager", "when": "Start of month", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-review", "title": "Weekly kill / keep / scale", "short": "Written rules, drafted by Claude, signed off by Andres.", "detail": "Kill at 2x target cost per qualified appointment with zero appointments. Scale under target for 7 days by about 20% every 3–4 days. Refresh when frequency passes ~3 or click rate drops 30%.", "mode": "hybrid", "owner": "andres", "tool": "Claude scheduled task + Windsor.ai", "when": "Every Monday", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-capi", "title": "Send outcomes to Meta", "short": "Showed / quoted / won go back so Meta learns real jobs.", "detail": "HubSpot stages flow to Meta's Conversions API for CRM. Once there's enough volume, switch the goal to Conversion Leads. Expect 2–3 months to learn.", "mode": "auto", "owner": "andres", "tool": "HubSpot / Zapier → Meta CAPI", "when": "Daily", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-report", "title": "15-day client report", "short": "Spend, appointments, cost per appointment, jobs won.", "detail": "What was cut and what we're doubling down on, drafted by Claude and sent by Esteban.", "mode": "hybrid", "owner": "esteban", "tool": "Claude + Windsor.ai + HubSpot", "when": "Every 15 days", "feeds": [], "done": false}, {"id": "ad-double", "title": "Double down on winners", "short": "Winning concepts get 3 new hooks next month.", "detail": "Winners flow into next month's strategy.", "mode": "manual", "owner": "isabella", "tool": "Notion", "when": "Monthly", "feeds": ["s-strategy"], "done": false}]}], "date": ""}, {"id": "sys6", "code": "6", "name": "Lead management & appointments", "short": "Speed to lead, qualify, book, hand over, bill.", "cadence": "Real time", "stages": [{"id": "st6", "name": "Lead to appointment", "when": "Real time", "steps": [{"id": "a-alert", "title": "Lead alert", "short": "Shared QUO inbox + HubSpot \"Call now\" task.", "detail": "Alerts go to a shared inbox, not anyone's personal phone, so whoever is on duty sees them.", "mode": "auto",